Sill for Huawei MatePad Mini

This project is an unofficial, independent port. It is not affiliated with,
sponsored by, or endorsed by the authors of Sill or by Huawei.

It is a clean reimplementation of a client for Sill (https://github.com/Saffsanity/sill),
licensed under the Apache License 2.0. The wire protocol, the pairing scheme and the
overall design that this client reimplements come from the upstream Sill project. Sill for
Mac is used unmodified; this repository contains only a new Android client.

